  3. Warmup (required before benchmark):
     hey -m POST -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
       -d '{"prompt":"bench"}' -c 300 -n 3000 \
       http://localhost:8082/api/auth/trigger > /dev/null

  4. Upstream baseline:
     hey -m POST -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
       -d '{"model":"gpt-4","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"bench"}]}' \
       -c 300 -n 3000 http://localhost:4545/v1/chat/completions

  5. Gateway benchmark:
     hey -m POST -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
       -d '{"prompt":"bench"}' -c 300 -n 3000 \
       http://localhost:8082/api/auth/trigger

     Compare Requests/sec between step 4 vs 5 to measure overhead.
     For dashboard view, use: -z 30s instead of -n 3000

